{"id":"698828b14a18fc85","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-lem-elimination.md","title":"Cut Elimination","display":"lem-elimination — Cut Elimination","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-elimination","aliases":["58-lem-elimination"],"display":"lem-elimination — Cut Elimination","depends_on":["[[58-df-proof-system]]","[[58-df-proof]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-elimination — Cut Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d63c357151e48e9d\" href=\"?note=d63c357151e48e9d\" title=\"58-df-proof-system\">58-df-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"58-df-proof\">58-df-proof</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LJ}\">\\(\\mathrm{LJ}\\)</span> are fixed standard set-codings <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\rangle\\)</span> of the classical and intuitionistic Gentzen calculi</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> is their fixed sequent-code language, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\ulcorner\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}})\">\\(s=\\ulcorner\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}})\\)</span>; for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LJ}\">\\(\\mathrm{LJ}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Delta|\\leq1\">\\(|\\Delta|\\leq1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cut}_{\\mathcal G}\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cut}_{\\mathcal G}\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\)</span> is the designated set-coded cut rule</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S\\)</span> are the proof-object projections defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequent\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,s,\\mathcal G,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequent\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,s,\\mathcal G,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cut\\text{-}erasure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G^{-})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathcal G=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal G^{-}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\n\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{Cut}_{\\mathcal G}\\}\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cut\\text{-}erasure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G^{-})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathcal G=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal G^{-}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\n\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{Cut}_{\\mathcal G}\\}\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cut\\text{-}free\\text{-}sequent\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal G^{-}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G^{-})\n\\land\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,s,\\mathcal G^{-},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}})\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cut\\text{-}free\\text{-}sequent\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal G^{-}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G^{-})\n\\land\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,s,\\mathcal G^{-},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}})\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK},\\mathrm{LJ}\\}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\n\\to\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S(\\pi&#39;,s,\\mathcal G)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK},\\mathrm{LJ}\\}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\n\\to\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S(\\pi&#39;,s,\\mathcal G)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The calculus is fixed to the standard LK/LJ rule sets.  Both proof notions are now exact projections of the registered five-place proof-object predicate, and “cut free” means provable after deleting precisely the designated cut rule.</li>\n<li>This is a metatheorem about the two fixed codes; it is not generalized to arbitrary extensions of Gentzen calculi, for which cut admissibility can fail.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proof]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LJ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"s=\\ulcorner\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LJ}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Delta|\\leq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cut}_{\\mathcal G}\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequent\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,s,\\mathcal G,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cut\\text{-}erasure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G^{-})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathcal G=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal G^{-}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal G},\n\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal G}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{Cut}_{\\mathcal G}\\}\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cut\\text{-}free\\text{-}sequent\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal G^{-}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CutErasure}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G^{-})\n\\land\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,s,\\mathcal G^{-},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{seq}})\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal G\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK},\\mathrm{LJ}\\}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SeqProof}_S(\\pi,s,\\mathcal G)\n\\to\\exists\\pi'\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CutFreeSeqProof}_S(\\pi',s,\\mathcal G)\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2691,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3893","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-lem-elimination.md|58-lem-elimination]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["d63c357151e48e9d","68fd6aebcf2cd4ac"]}